cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PALISADE or SIEGE, please cite the paper below."
title: "PALISADE and SIEGE"
abstract: >-
  PALISADE is a privileged security-mediation sidecar for agentic scientific
  platforms, gating six boundaries of a deployed agentic platform with
  deterministic admission predicates over labels assigned outside the model.
  SIEGE is its companion adversarial benchmark: 205 attack instances across
  42 classes against a 181-task benign control, scoring an evaded inspection
  tier separately from a value reaching a privileged sink with its label
  stripped.
type: software
